// Paw & Claw - Faction Definitions
// Modify this file to customize faction names, colors, and properties
//
// Factions are cosmetic: name, color, animals and sprites. As in Advance Wars,
// every gameplay effect (prices, stats, powers) comes from the commander
// (commanders.ron).

(
    factions: {
        "eastern": (
            name: "Eastern Empire",
            description: "Disciplined armies of the rising sun. Strength in numbers.",
